WEBVTT

00:01.565 --> 00:02.902
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.926 --> 00:04.261
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.285 --> 00:07.501
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.525 --> 00:13.085
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.085 --> 01:31.045
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.205 --> 01:34.445
=Episode 36=

02:02.695 --> 02:03.695
Stop!

02:10.720 --> 02:12.865
My friend left something up there.

02:13.020 --> 02:14.225
I'll only take that thing

02:14.345 --> 02:15.545
and won't touch anything else.

02:23.970 --> 02:25.825
Do we have to fight you?

02:31.795 --> 02:33.385
We're going to have a fight.

02:33.620 --> 02:34.620
What's your plan?

02:36.020 --> 02:37.670
I'll fight with you.

02:38.145 --> 02:39.145
Good.

02:39.770 --> 02:41.185
What a good brother.

02:43.220 --> 02:45.505
You want to reap the spoils?

02:47.095 --> 02:48.265
What did you say?

02:48.595 --> 02:50.120
I said I agreed with you.

02:51.295 --> 02:53.241
Since you decide to fight with me,

02:53.265 --> 02:56.695
I must help you out.

02:57.145 --> 02:58.321
Brother!

02:58.345 --> 02:59.496
What are you doing, Brother?

02:59.520 --> 03:01.385
I'm just a child.

03:01.895 --> 03:03.481
Get ready to fight my brother.

03:03.505 --> 03:04.995
I'm just a child.

03:43.920 --> 03:45.545
Brother, you're highly skilled.

03:45.995 --> 03:47.795
Were you waiting for this moment?

03:48.220 --> 03:50.745
I was waiting for you
to crush our opponents.

03:57.070 --> 03:58.985
In fact, I don't work for Xu Fengnian.

03:59.070 --> 04:00.086
He told the truth.

04:00.110 --> 04:01.481
Please go easy on him.

04:01.505 --> 04:02.505
Hey, Brother.

04:08.570 --> 04:10.720
Where did the boy come from?

04:11.195 --> 04:13.075
After all, Xu is the son of
Lord of North Liang.

04:13.845 --> 04:14.845
He's probably

04:15.195 --> 04:16.825
a secret guard of his.

04:29.620 --> 04:32.025
The secret was kept well, then.

04:32.595 --> 04:34.770
It's never been exposed until now.

04:42.420 --> 04:43.745
What an adept!

04:44.545 --> 04:47.145
He must be Xu Fengnian's master card.

04:48.370 --> 04:50.465
We've checked out

04:50.545 --> 04:51.825
all the people around him

04:52.620 --> 04:54.670
except for the boy.

04:55.195 --> 04:56.305
We should spare no effort

04:56.995 --> 04:58.270
to kill him first.

04:59.870 --> 05:01.401
Shouldn't we kill Xu Fengnian first?

05:01.425 --> 05:04.095
It's best if we can do that.

05:04.745 --> 05:06.145
But look at him.

05:06.670 --> 05:08.270
Facing six martial slaves,

05:08.795 --> 05:10.385
he still takes the lead.

05:10.620 --> 05:11.860
He's extremely loyal and brave.

05:12.095 --> 05:13.385
If we kill Xu Fengnian first,

05:14.105 --> 05:16.120
he'll surely step forward.

05:18.470 --> 05:19.595
Let's be patient.

05:26.995 --> 05:27.995
Sounds fair.

05:36.020 --> 05:37.020
Stop!

06:31.320 --> 06:32.320
Your Highness,

06:32.445 --> 06:33.481
I think the martial slaves

06:33.505 --> 06:35.095
haven't tried their best to stop us.

06:35.620 --> 06:36.670
We've come this far.

06:37.070 --> 06:38.270
There's no need to turn round.

06:52.870 --> 06:53.920
(Liaojia Fishing Shop)

06:54.345 --> 06:55.345
Here is a chance.

06:56.495 --> 06:57.820
(Liaojia Fishing Shop)

07:10.845 --> 07:11.845
Go.

09:26.395 --> 09:27.875
There are 12 martial slaves in total.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.320
Yes.

09:30.620 --> 09:31.845
They're all here.

09:43.495 --> 09:44.495
You're here, too.

09:53.845 --> 09:54.522
Your Highness, how are you?

09:54.546 --> 09:55.595
I'm your brother-in-law.

10:05.770 --> 10:06.820
Hello, again.

10:08.745 --> 10:09.770
We are family.

10:10.395 --> 10:11.395
Let me help you.

10:17.095 --> 10:18.220
Are you suspicious of me?

10:20.620 --> 10:22.585
I know Fujiang Armor.

10:23.645 --> 10:25.881
What if I say
it has nothing to do with me?

10:25.905 --> 10:27.065
Do you think I'll believe it?

10:30.120 --> 10:31.081
I won't join you, then.

10:31.105 --> 10:32.065
Enjoy your fight.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.495
Your Highness, please.

10:35.570 --> 10:37.145
You want to kick me when I'm down?

10:40.520 --> 10:41.671
Facing the six martial slaves,

10:41.695 --> 10:44.020
I don't think you'll be well protected.

10:46.845 --> 10:48.161
What if I go no further

10:48.185 --> 10:49.345
and leave for good?

10:50.920 --> 10:52.720
Your Highness,
you're not that kind of person.

10:53.270 --> 10:54.270
You're right.

10:55.945 --> 10:56.697
Your Highness,

10:56.721 --> 10:57.796
we're attacked from front and rear.

10:57.820 --> 10:59.020
The situation goes against us.

11:01.145 --> 11:02.761
When soldiers are besieged by the enemy

11:02.785 --> 11:03.747
and can't find a way out,

11:03.771 --> 11:04.785
what should they do?

11:06.620 --> 11:08.220
They should fight their way out.

11:17.095 --> 11:18.095
Yes.

11:18.985 --> 11:20.445
Fight our way out.

12:37.145 --> 12:38.145
Iron Armor.

12:42.520 --> 12:43.271
Green Plum.

12:43.295 --> 12:44.295
Bamboo Horse.

12:44.745 --> 12:45.395
Spring Water.

12:45.420 --> 12:46.146
Morning Dew.

12:46.170 --> 12:46.920
Peach Blossom.

12:47.095 --> 12:48.095
Rise.

12:52.970 --> 12:53.970
Go.

13:25.895 --> 13:27.645
(North Gate)

13:36.320 --> 13:37.445
Why do you stop?

13:38.320 --> 13:40.025
Deng Tai'e joined in.

13:40.720 --> 13:42.145
It makes no difference

13:42.945 --> 13:44.395
whether they fight or not.

13:52.195 --> 13:53.195
Come back.

14:00.120 --> 14:01.920
Thanks for the sword.

14:06.595 --> 14:08.345
Thanks for the six swords.

14:08.745 --> 14:09.846
Senior, if I may ask,

14:09.870 --> 14:11.425
are you Sword God Peach Blossom?

14:12.195 --> 14:13.670
I am Deng Tai'e.

14:13.995 --> 14:15.185
I remember

14:15.345 --> 14:16.546
your kindness.

14:16.570 --> 14:18.010
I'll return the favor in the future.

14:18.045 --> 14:19.145
You have nothing to return.

14:19.795 --> 14:20.985
I was returning you a favor.

14:22.470 --> 14:23.470
Xu Fengnian.

14:24.270 --> 14:25.270
Your mother

14:25.395 --> 14:27.120
was a distant cousin to me.

14:27.195 --> 14:28.821
Was that some kind of kinship?

14:28.845 --> 14:30.020
How lucky he is

14:31.025 --> 14:32.146
born in such a family.

14:32.170 --> 14:34.970
When I was practicing swordplay
in Sword Tomb of the Wu family,

14:35.445 --> 14:36.695
your mother did me many favors

14:37.045 --> 14:38.425
of giving me meals,

14:38.945 --> 14:40.420
saving my life,

14:40.445 --> 14:41.445
and

14:41.595 --> 14:43.045
giving me instruction.

14:43.295 --> 14:44.845
Those were great favors.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.770
How could I not return?

14:50.620 --> 14:51.695
Sadly,

14:52.320 --> 14:54.720
when you mother
went to the imperial city alone,

14:55.020 --> 14:56.870
I was outside the East Sea.

14:57.545 --> 14:58.625
When I came back,

14:59.595 --> 15:01.020
it was too late.

15:01.795 --> 15:03.060
She got hurt in fighting

15:03.470 --> 15:04.745
and was never cured.

15:05.470 --> 15:06.820
At last, she died.

15:07.995 --> 15:09.195
Every time I think about it,

15:10.095 --> 15:11.720
I feel guilty.

15:15.420 --> 15:17.145
The favors I owed to your mother,

15:17.645 --> 15:19.220
today, I've returned a half

15:19.720 --> 15:21.265
using the six swords.

15:22.545 --> 15:23.665
On the wall,

15:23.995 --> 15:25.270
you can take

15:25.720 --> 15:27.195
whatever you want to.

15:43.545 --> 15:44.995
The 12 flying swords

15:45.320 --> 15:47.105
have been with me throughout my life.

15:47.320 --> 15:48.320
Today,

15:48.345 --> 15:49.545
I give them to you.

15:50.145 --> 15:52.045
The art of killing with flying swords

15:52.595 --> 15:54.025
lies in the box.

15:54.345 --> 15:56.105
It's up to you whether you can

15:56.495 --> 15:58.520
comprehend it or not.

15:58.995 --> 16:00.945
I've returned the other half

16:01.320 --> 16:02.695
of the favors.

16:02.795 --> 16:03.795
Your Highness.

16:04.170 --> 16:05.345
From now on,

16:05.695 --> 16:07.070
we don't owe each other again.

16:09.245 --> 16:10.245
Thanks.

16:12.170 --> 16:13.481
Your Highness,
put the flying swords away first.

16:13.505 --> 16:14.595
Later.

16:14.970 --> 16:16.371
The flying sword skill
of Sword God Peach Blossom

16:16.395 --> 16:17.821
is supreme and unique.

16:17.845 --> 16:18.895
I know.

16:19.570 --> 16:21.265
But I'm shortsighted.

16:22.145 --> 16:23.145
Right now,

16:23.870 --> 16:25.945
the sword box
is the most important thing to me.

16:32.045 --> 16:33.170
Mr. Deng,

16:33.520 --> 16:34.761
if you want to kill me,

16:34.785 --> 16:35.905
you'd better do it early,

16:36.095 --> 16:37.761
lest I'm agitated

16:37.785 --> 16:39.321
waiting here.

16:39.345 --> 16:40.745
I've returned all the favors

16:41.070 --> 16:42.305
and finished what has started.

16:42.945 --> 16:44.570
He has nothing to do with me now.

16:44.845 --> 16:45.845
So,

16:45.895 --> 16:47.801
if I'm going to strike Xu Fengnian,

16:47.825 --> 16:48.796
won't you use your swords?

16:48.820 --> 16:49.820
My swords

16:50.495 --> 16:51.595
were given away.

16:53.870 --> 16:55.361
As Sword God Peach Blossom,

16:55.385 --> 16:57.145
your every word must carry weight.

17:01.720 --> 17:02.720
Hm?

17:04.470 --> 17:05.470
Not now.

17:06.395 --> 17:07.395
I'm not stupid.

17:07.545 --> 17:09.896
The first half of the favors
Mr. Deng has to return

17:09.920 --> 17:11.271
is to help your master

17:11.295 --> 17:12.770
take the sword box on the wall.

17:13.120 --> 17:14.320
If I'm going to strike him,

17:14.445 --> 17:15.761
I would wait until he gets the box

17:15.785 --> 17:17.545
and Mr. Deng
finishes returning the favor.

17:17.795 --> 17:19.320
Now, no one in the world

17:19.670 --> 17:21.895
could stop your master

17:22.195 --> 17:23.570
from getting the box.

17:35.645 --> 17:37.045
Is this yours?

17:39.120 --> 17:40.281
His Highness's talking to you.

17:40.305 --> 17:41.645
Answer the question.

17:43.920 --> 17:44.945
It's mine.

17:46.295 --> 17:47.295
Your Highness,

17:47.745 --> 17:49.595
he is the new groom.

17:49.895 --> 17:50.895
He doesn't need to

17:51.095 --> 17:51.821
take the old stuff into the mansion.

17:51.845 --> 17:52.845
Yeah.

17:58.145 --> 18:00.425
How long have you been taking it?

18:02.145 --> 18:03.425
Very long.

18:04.070 --> 18:05.561
It's your stuff.

18:05.585 --> 18:06.585
Take it.

18:08.170 --> 18:09.345
I don't necessarily need it.

18:10.420 --> 18:11.720
My mother used to say,

18:11.895 --> 18:13.696
what accompanied you

18:13.720 --> 18:14.905
had a bond with you,

18:15.220 --> 18:17.620
no matter it's a person or a thing.

18:18.445 --> 18:20.845
I don't quite understand it.

18:21.470 --> 18:23.865
Anyway, don't throw your old stuff away.

18:24.170 --> 18:25.496
When you want it back in the future,

18:25.520 --> 18:26.520
how can you find it?

18:27.420 --> 18:28.420
Yeah.

18:55.370 --> 18:56.595
Guess what I've found?

18:56.970 --> 18:57.970
Ah?

18:58.545 --> 18:59.995
What did you find?

19:02.295 --> 19:03.295
Look.

19:03.495 --> 19:04.595
I got it back for you.

19:05.020 --> 19:05.622
I...

19:05.646 --> 19:06.920
I don't necessarily need it.

19:07.370 --> 19:08.241
All these years,

19:08.265 --> 19:09.505
you've been taking it with you.

19:09.795 --> 19:10.915
It must be important to you.

19:12.245 --> 19:13.825
It's all in the past.

19:14.120 --> 19:16.095
Why deny the man who you used to be?

19:16.495 --> 19:17.441
Don't you think he made the man

19:17.465 --> 19:18.465
who you are today?

19:20.120 --> 19:21.171
Anyway,

19:21.195 --> 19:22.870
you're Old Huang to me.

19:23.520 --> 19:24.362
Since it was the will of heaven

19:24.386 --> 19:25.895
that helped you find it...

19:27.570 --> 19:28.995
Don't throw it again.

19:29.020 --> 19:30.020
Yeah.

19:54.220 --> 19:55.370
What's your surname?

19:55.695 --> 19:56.920
It's Huang.

19:57.970 --> 19:59.020
Oh.

19:59.120 --> 20:00.985
I'll call you Old Huang, then.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.070
OK.

20:09.170 --> 20:12.825
♪ Old dog Old dog ♪

20:13.820 --> 20:17.345
♪ There is no dog like you ♪

20:18.895 --> 20:22.265
♪ Tail broken ♪

20:23.770 --> 20:26.025
♪ There is ♪

20:27.295 --> 20:30.465
♪ No way back ♪

20:33.520 --> 20:36.785
♪ Old dog Old dog ♪

20:38.220 --> 20:41.705
♪ There is no dog like you ♪

20:43.020 --> 20:46.385
♪ Buried in the earth ♪

20:47.870 --> 20:51.970
♪ Distress in the joy ♪

22:46.520 --> 22:48.425
Common people use fire,

22:49.020 --> 22:50.585
copper and iron,

22:50.995 --> 22:52.785
as well as spirit lifeblood
to forge swords.

22:53.120 --> 22:54.120
Today,

22:54.495 --> 22:56.270
by force of yin and yang,

22:56.745 --> 22:57.985
flame of heart light,

22:58.045 --> 22:59.565
power of thunderbolt,

22:59.945 --> 23:01.370
unity of heaven and earth,

23:02.270 --> 23:04.065
till now,

23:04.670 --> 23:06.120
I finally perfected

23:08.970 --> 23:10.170
the sword intent.

23:41.070 --> 23:42.265
Open

23:42.520 --> 23:43.970
the Heaven's Gate.

23:53.120 --> 23:55.320
Li Chungang is a real sword god.

24:03.220 --> 24:04.245
Excellent.

24:05.695 --> 24:07.041
My sword intent

24:07.065 --> 24:08.225
could open the Heaven's Gate.

24:08.395 --> 24:10.570
Could it kill you?

24:19.820 --> 24:20.995
What a great

24:21.570 --> 24:23.245
sword intent!

24:47.620 --> 24:48.445
Junior Master,

24:48.570 --> 24:49.810
did you steal vegetables again?

24:58.920 --> 24:59.681
Junior Master.

24:59.705 --> 25:00.705
What's wrong?

25:00.845 --> 25:01.720
I have no idea.

25:01.770 --> 25:03.420
What did he find?

25:03.820 --> 25:05.070
He was just fine.

25:05.105 --> 25:05.895
What happened to him?

25:05.970 --> 25:07.120
He was fine just now.

25:07.420 --> 25:08.670
Junior Master.

25:09.595 --> 25:10.955
- Don't touch him.
- Junior Master.

25:15.495 --> 25:16.272
What happened?

25:16.296 --> 25:18.070
Junior Master stood here still just now,

25:18.320 --> 25:19.496
gazing at the skyline.

25:19.520 --> 25:20.680
Suddenly he became like this.

25:22.745 --> 25:23.820
Which direction?

25:24.445 --> 25:25.520
- There.
- There.

25:27.065 --> 25:28.470
The east.

25:32.495 --> 25:34.145
Put up a shed over his head.

25:35.095 --> 25:36.095
And then?

25:37.345 --> 25:39.170
Don't do anything else.

25:40.145 --> 25:41.745
Wait till he wakes up.

25:46.020 --> 25:47.995
What happened in the east

25:49.670 --> 25:51.595
that woke you up?

26:23.995 --> 26:26.265
The moment finally comes.

26:42.220 --> 26:43.895
I've never seen such a fight.

26:44.820 --> 26:46.395
What an eye-opener!

26:47.370 --> 26:48.370
Do you think

26:49.345 --> 26:50.720
they are still human?

26:51.295 --> 26:51.945
Yes.

26:52.045 --> 26:53.045
Oh?

26:54.095 --> 26:55.505
I don't know about Wang Xianzhi.

26:55.620 --> 26:57.145
But Sword God Li is definitely human.

26:58.470 --> 26:59.720
Have you got the sword box?

27:01.770 --> 27:03.705
Can I fight you now?

27:09.145 --> 27:11.145
Do you think you have any chance?

27:11.720 --> 27:13.270
Sword God Li is busy now.

27:13.995 --> 27:16.020
Do you think he can take care of you?

27:25.995 --> 27:27.770
There is another one hiding in here?

27:36.220 --> 27:37.905
Sword God Peach Blossom

27:38.420 --> 27:40.695
didn't just come for
Xu Fengnian, did you?

27:42.420 --> 27:44.095
Nice to meet you, Master Zhao.

27:46.420 --> 27:47.620
Do you know me?

27:48.820 --> 27:50.045
Though I've never met you,

27:51.020 --> 27:52.370
your name

27:52.645 --> 27:54.295
pierced my ear like thunder.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.145
What a coincidence.

27:57.070 --> 27:58.745
Of the few people who know me,

27:59.545 --> 28:00.770
I actually come across one.

28:03.020 --> 28:04.195
You're lucky.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.720
I don't understand.

28:06.195 --> 28:08.770
After Li Chungang and Wang Xianzhi
started to fight,

28:09.445 --> 28:10.945
I was planning to kill you,

28:11.970 --> 28:13.745
but in my heart lake,

28:14.095 --> 28:15.865
I perceived a peerless master

28:16.185 --> 28:17.545
outside Wudi City.

28:18.895 --> 28:20.625
I then decided to wait,

28:21.320 --> 28:23.040
not expecting it was
Sword God Peach Blossom

28:23.220 --> 28:25.520
who came to pay a debt of gratitude.

28:26.020 --> 28:28.345
When you fought
the martial slaves just now,

28:28.820 --> 28:29.980
did you hide your capacities?

28:30.095 --> 28:31.345
I was messing with them.

28:31.620 --> 28:32.870
Why should I be serious?

28:33.345 --> 28:35.270
What's your real identity?

28:37.070 --> 28:39.495
There is no need to hide it now.

28:40.320 --> 28:42.345
I'm from Mount Longhu,

28:42.620 --> 28:44.185
Zhao Xuansu.

28:44.345 --> 28:45.225
The generation of Xuan?

28:45.295 --> 28:46.095
Your Highness,

28:46.270 --> 28:48.281
the generation of Xuan
is two generations senior

28:48.305 --> 28:49.585
than the Master of Mount Longhu.

28:49.770 --> 28:50.770
I'm afraid Master Zhao

28:51.065 --> 28:52.895
is almost 140 years old.

28:54.625 --> 28:56.370
I've guessed you might attack me,

28:56.745 --> 28:58.546
not expecting you are of
such a high generation.

28:58.570 --> 29:00.220
It must be hard for you

29:00.745 --> 29:02.296
to call me Brother these days.

29:02.320 --> 29:03.641
I don't care about it.

29:03.665 --> 29:05.095
Why should you care?

29:06.145 --> 29:08.220
May I venture to ask
if you still want to kill me?

29:09.970 --> 29:12.170
I was planning to do so.

29:12.595 --> 29:14.470
But Deng Tai'e is here, after all.

29:15.020 --> 29:17.220
I should show some respect to him.

29:18.895 --> 29:19.895
Senior,

29:20.970 --> 29:22.795
you come to kill Xu Fengnian, too?

29:23.495 --> 29:25.745
Senior Deng just said,

29:26.020 --> 29:27.681
he had finished returning favors.

29:27.705 --> 29:28.705
From now on,

29:28.895 --> 29:31.021
Xu Fengnian's life or death
has nothing to do with him.

29:31.045 --> 29:32.641
This Young Master

29:32.665 --> 29:34.570
deserves to be killed.

29:36.620 --> 29:38.345
I'd like to join hands with you.

29:39.020 --> 29:40.681
If Senior Deng doesn't help,

29:40.705 --> 29:41.945
these people

29:42.095 --> 29:43.785
can't stop you.

29:44.720 --> 29:47.220
The Fujiang Armor below is yours?

29:47.595 --> 29:48.845
If you like,

29:49.095 --> 29:50.385
just take it.

29:50.620 --> 29:52.470
Are you Zhao Kai?

29:52.785 --> 29:54.070
You know me?

29:56.320 --> 29:58.420
I won't kill Xu Fengnian.

30:00.185 --> 30:01.720
It makes

30:02.495 --> 30:03.645
no difference to kill you.

30:18.770 --> 30:21.295
Do you try to resist me with a puppet?

30:22.545 --> 30:24.195
If I said or did anything wrong,

30:24.345 --> 30:26.455
I apologize for it.

30:28.320 --> 30:31.145
Xu Fengnian is the cause of chaos,

30:31.270 --> 30:32.745
so are you.

30:33.370 --> 30:35.770
Mount Longhu is in debt to His Majesty.

30:36.295 --> 30:37.771
Let me kill you today

30:37.795 --> 30:39.220
to return the favor.

30:41.045 --> 30:42.265
Are you crazy?

30:42.645 --> 30:43.795
Why do you save him?

30:44.445 --> 30:46.295
Senior Zhao, please go easy on him.

30:46.620 --> 30:48.470
He was trying to kill you all the way.

30:51.770 --> 30:52.970
Can you tell me

30:53.045 --> 30:54.045
why you want to

30:54.195 --> 30:55.270
save me?

30:57.995 --> 30:59.021
You shouldn't

30:59.045 --> 31:00.120
die here.

31:01.545 --> 31:02.545
Why don't you run?

31:30.570 --> 31:32.271
Thinking about it over and over again,

31:32.295 --> 31:34.470
I still don't know the reason
why you saved him.

31:35.445 --> 31:37.320
Normally,

31:37.445 --> 31:39.345
you might be crazy.

31:40.120 --> 31:41.120
I might be.

31:41.395 --> 31:42.495
But I know,

31:42.770 --> 31:44.995
you're deep-minded.

31:45.995 --> 31:46.995
The reason

31:47.345 --> 31:47.962
why you saved him

31:47.986 --> 31:50.370
must be extremely important.

31:51.120 --> 31:52.945
I apologize.

31:55.270 --> 31:56.681
Young people

31:56.705 --> 31:58.545
are more and more surprising now.

31:59.895 --> 32:01.845
If Deng Tai'e isn't here,

32:02.645 --> 32:04.370
I might have killed you.

32:05.545 --> 32:08.045
Please show mercy

32:08.320 --> 32:09.395
and let those two go.

32:12.020 --> 32:14.720
Anyway, you'll get
what you deserve in the future.

32:33.025 --> 32:34.220
What was happening?

32:55.195 --> 32:56.345
Thank you very much.

32:57.695 --> 32:59.445
You didn't come here

32:59.745 --> 33:01.295
just to kill us, did you?

33:01.695 --> 33:02.695
Yeah.

33:02.745 --> 33:05.161
I'll take the chance to ascend to heaven

33:05.185 --> 33:06.245
when Heaven's Gate opens.

33:06.495 --> 33:07.495
Heaven's Gate?

33:07.820 --> 33:09.471
When you come to the
ultimate realm of martial arts,

33:09.495 --> 33:11.665
you may have the chance to
become an immortal.

33:11.795 --> 33:13.046
To do that,

33:13.070 --> 33:14.745
you must wait till Heaven's Gate opens.

33:15.095 --> 33:17.120
Though I look like a boy,

33:17.295 --> 33:19.801
I'm getting rotten inwardly.

33:19.825 --> 33:22.265
After all,
I've been waiting for 120 years.

33:22.670 --> 33:24.345
Why did you tell me this?

33:24.570 --> 33:26.645
I finally get the chance
ascending to heaven.

33:28.345 --> 33:30.895
It doesn't hurt to tell you.

33:32.920 --> 33:34.245
Heaven's Gate reopens

33:35.095 --> 33:37.415
because of the fight between
Sword God Li and Wang Xianzhi?

33:37.595 --> 33:39.920
I'm afraid the gate only reopens

33:40.070 --> 33:41.905
because of their fight.

33:42.245 --> 33:43.720
I'm not wrong.

33:44.720 --> 33:46.295
The gate is opening.

33:46.870 --> 33:48.420
The wonderland will befall.

33:49.245 --> 33:51.745
I can finally take the step.

33:53.845 --> 33:55.121
Sword God Peach Blossom

33:55.145 --> 33:56.570
came here

33:57.320 --> 33:59.446
for this, too, I suppose.

33:59.470 --> 34:00.470
You're right.

34:00.845 --> 34:02.870
I do come for Heaven's Gate.

34:07.170 --> 34:09.171
The gate is about to open.

34:09.195 --> 34:11.745
We both have the chance to ascend.

34:12.495 --> 34:15.020
Maybe we can work together.

34:20.145 --> 34:21.895
They're fighting
with all their strength.

35:00.970 --> 35:02.370
It's only one step away.

35:07.695 --> 35:08.865
Shall we continue?

35:09.420 --> 35:11.520
Heaven's Gate is opening.

35:24.820 --> 35:27.270
The outcome is still pending.

35:39.545 --> 35:41.305
What are they doing?

35:41.520 --> 35:42.785
Why do they stop?

35:42.945 --> 35:43.722
For decades,

35:43.746 --> 35:45.546
this is the only chance
to open Heaven's Gate.

35:46.145 --> 35:48.071
Are they going to let it go?

35:48.095 --> 35:49.520
Maybe they don't want to

35:50.870 --> 35:52.345
ascend to heaven.

35:53.595 --> 35:55.145
They don't want to?

35:55.970 --> 35:57.070
Why not?

35:57.170 --> 35:58.745
They perhaps would rather stay on earth

35:59.820 --> 36:01.770
than go to the wonderland.

36:06.105 --> 36:08.220
What on earth deserves to stay for?

36:08.345 --> 36:10.630
How can they miss the chance?

36:10.995 --> 36:12.825
The moment has already come.

36:13.195 --> 36:14.570
With extra force,

36:14.920 --> 36:16.420
we can open Heaven's Gate

36:16.695 --> 36:18.045
and welcome the wonderland.

36:18.745 --> 36:20.320
In this case,

36:21.120 --> 36:23.245
let me open the gate.

36:24.320 --> 36:25.320
Rise.

36:34.370 --> 36:35.970
Deng Tai'e, what are you doing?

36:37.245 --> 36:39.585
You just said something wrong.

36:40.170 --> 36:41.745
I do come here

36:41.895 --> 36:44.505
for Heaven's Gate.

36:44.820 --> 36:45.820
However,

36:46.545 --> 36:47.865
I don't want it to open.

36:48.095 --> 36:49.570
What do you want, then?

36:51.470 --> 36:52.645
I want to

36:53.045 --> 36:55.025
stop it from opening

36:55.320 --> 36:56.395
and cut off the connection

36:56.745 --> 36:58.796
between the wonderland and the earth.

36:58.820 --> 36:59.820
Why?

37:00.270 --> 37:01.345
Ancient books

37:01.520 --> 37:02.705
have recorded

37:02.995 --> 37:04.185
the visits of immortals.

37:05.495 --> 37:06.770
The so-called immortals

37:07.420 --> 37:09.120
have long cast their mortal hearts away.

37:09.445 --> 37:11.005
They think they represent heaven's way.

37:11.320 --> 37:12.905
Every time when immortals befall,

37:13.095 --> 37:14.345
they would change

37:14.795 --> 37:17.145
the world's situation at will.

37:17.270 --> 37:18.561
Diversion of rivers

37:18.585 --> 37:19.472
and shift of mountains

37:19.496 --> 37:20.625
usually happen.

37:21.495 --> 37:22.595
What's more,

37:23.465 --> 37:25.196
some immortals would decide
human's life or death

37:25.220 --> 37:27.145
according to their likes and dislikes.

37:28.895 --> 37:30.095
Numerous people die

37:30.720 --> 37:32.520
because of them.

37:33.095 --> 37:34.215
So what?

37:35.045 --> 37:36.746
The change of dynasties in the world

37:36.770 --> 37:38.370
also causes numerous death.

37:38.945 --> 37:40.170
If nothing else,

37:40.445 --> 37:42.225
he is the son of Lord of North Liang.

37:42.995 --> 37:45.505
How many people died
because of his father?

37:45.845 --> 37:47.995
Why don't you kill him?

37:48.345 --> 37:49.770
The change of dynasties

37:50.245 --> 37:52.145
is the struggle of human.

37:52.295 --> 37:53.585
I've never wanted to

37:53.895 --> 37:55.465
stop all the killings in the world.

37:57.220 --> 37:58.220
As a matter of fact,

37:59.695 --> 38:01.295
the swordplay I've been practicing

38:01.695 --> 38:03.295
is the art of killing.

38:04.520 --> 38:05.985
But human's affairs

38:06.420 --> 38:08.145
should be decided by human.

38:08.870 --> 38:09.920
The mortal world

38:10.170 --> 38:11.595
doesn't need immortals.

38:11.820 --> 38:13.070
Just because of that,

38:13.420 --> 38:15.371
you want to stop Heaven's Gate
from reopening,

38:15.395 --> 38:17.825
and block the way
of all martial artists in the world?

38:18.545 --> 38:19.545
I am

38:19.595 --> 38:21.420
never a reasonable man.

38:22.170 --> 38:23.825
Stopping me from ascending,

38:23.920 --> 38:26.025
you're my sworn enemy.

38:28.970 --> 38:30.420
You can't stop me, anyway!

38:32.670 --> 38:33.561
Emei, Rosefinch,

38:33.585 --> 38:34.281
Phoenix Tree, Ant,

38:34.305 --> 38:35.246
Golden Thread, Tai'e,

38:35.270 --> 38:36.270
rise.

38:36.645 --> 38:37.645
Swords array.

38:38.345 --> 38:40.570
The swords array is called Disarm.

38:40.670 --> 38:42.545
It was originally
prepared for Wang Xianzhi.

38:42.770 --> 38:43.795
I didn't expect

38:44.170 --> 38:45.625
I would use it against you.

38:45.970 --> 38:47.520
I'd like to see

38:48.245 --> 38:51.170
if you can really disarm me.

38:57.195 --> 38:58.195
Go.

39:08.995 --> 39:10.121
Power of stars,

39:10.145 --> 39:11.395
might of thunder?

39:13.670 --> 39:14.970
Deng Tai'e,

39:15.345 --> 39:16.895
how dare you?

39:17.195 --> 39:18.195
Go.

40:29.445 --> 40:30.645
Deng Tai'e,

40:32.145 --> 40:34.195
you stand in my way of ascending.

40:34.720 --> 40:37.720
I must kill
all your relatives and friends.

40:40.170 --> 40:41.370
Master Zhao,

40:41.845 --> 40:43.045
stop now,

40:43.520 --> 40:45.020
and your life can be saved.

40:54.370 --> 40:55.845
Why bother like this?

40:56.670 --> 40:57.895
Doing that,

40:58.520 --> 41:00.420
you'll kill yourself.

41:10.595 --> 41:12.195
Being in Unity Realm,

41:13.385 --> 41:15.370
how can I be confined?

41:17.020 --> 41:18.305
I'm sick

41:19.870 --> 41:21.495
of the world!

41:28.645 --> 41:29.920
Born human,

41:30.645 --> 41:32.070
but you're sick of the world.

41:32.770 --> 41:34.395
How pathetic you are!

41:34.770 --> 41:37.270
Since we've achieved to Unity Realm,

41:37.845 --> 41:40.320
we're no longer an ordinary person.

41:41.095 --> 41:42.620
In order to get stronger,

41:42.920 --> 41:44.370
are you really going

41:44.670 --> 41:45.945
to cast away your mortal heart?

41:46.185 --> 41:48.245
What if I do?

41:48.645 --> 41:49.745
Senior Zhao,

41:50.620 --> 41:51.920
I won't allow

41:51.995 --> 41:53.970
any immortals to be in the world.

42:04.270 --> 42:05.270
Xu Fengnian!

42:07.670 --> 42:09.320
Since he is your benefactor's son,

42:09.795 --> 42:11.720
I'll kill him in front of you.

42:25.545 --> 42:27.420
Don't dream of ascending to heaven!

42:27.870 --> 42:28.895
The Ninth Move,

42:28.920 --> 42:30.295
Six Thousand Li!

42:57.695 --> 42:58.695
Back off!

43:29.825 --> 43:32.545
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.320 --> 43:37.120
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.045 --> 43:41.965
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.045 --> 43:46.845
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.145 --> 43:51.045
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.745 --> 43:55.565
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.570 --> 44:00.325
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.345 --> 44:05.270
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.770 --> 44:08.501
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.525 --> 44:09.765
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.545 --> 44:14.405
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.220 --> 44:17.946
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.970 --> 44:19.405
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.895 --> 44:23.770
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.195 --> 44:25.546
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.570 --> 44:28.405
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.820 --> 44:31.301
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.325 --> 44:33.725
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.020 --> 44:36.046
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.070 --> 44:38.246
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.270 --> 44:42.485
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.845 --> 44:43.981
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.005 --> 44:47.045
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.220 --> 44:49.181
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.205 --> 44:51.925
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.485 --> 44:54.301
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.325 --> 44:56.821
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.845 --> 45:00.945
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
